xt":"Revenue grew 19.7% year on year (Q2 2026 vs Q2 2025), reaching $266.8m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026050604/0001628280-26-050604-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-050604"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026050604/0001628280-26-050604-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-050604"},{"text":"Gross margin of 49.9% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026050604/0001628280-26-050604-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-050604"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 46.0% to 49.9% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026050604/0001628280-26-050604-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-050604"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $57.8m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026028363/0001628280-26-028363-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-028363"}],"bear":[{"text":"Diluted share count rose 13.2% over the year (Q2 2026 vs Q2 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026050604/0001628280-26-050604-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-050604"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.6% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809987/000162828026046239/0001628280-26-046239-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rat